# [NFSV4](../wg/nfsv4.html)

## Summary

The NFSV4 Working Group met to discuss document pipeline management, protocol element registries, retiring NFSv4.0 specifications, implementation updates for Flex Files v2, security document strategies, and the progression path for `draft-ietf-nfsv4-rfc8881bis`. Key outcomes include plans to issue a status change to retire NFSv4.0, a proposal for IANA registries for NFSv4 protocol elements, a managed DataTracker pipeline process for document adoption/WGLC, and a proposed strategy (Option 2) to streamline `draft-ietf-nfsv4-rfc8881bis` by backporting normative fixes to a diffable core base specification managed via GitHub.

