## Decisions and Action Items

### Decisions
* **NFSv4.0 Retirement:** Proceed with an IESG Status Change document to move NFSv4.0 specifications (RFC 7530, RFC 7531, RFC 7931, RFC 8587) to Historic/Retired status.
* **IANA Registries:** Prioritize adoption of the IANA registries document to update RFC 8178 and establish formal allocation procedures for NFSv4 protocol elements.
* **8881bis Strategy:** Issue a formal call on the mailing list to select Option 2 (backporting normative changes onto base RFC 8881 within GitHub) for `draft-ietf-nfsv4-rfc8881bis`.

